    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1065527401": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1537999583,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I got something for you, Kirby.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1743729369": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1537999583,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "(Show her the Lactation Inducer)",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1950929633": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Huh? You did? …Wait—no way, is that the thing?!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1838698250": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    163401542,
    607599665,
    298156980
   ],
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "The lactation booster?! Ohhh this is amazing! We can finally start for real!",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "163401542": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1838698250,
   "children": [
    1941922044
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’m glad you’re excited. This could save the farm.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "607599665": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1838698250,
   "children": [
    -1404837631
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Don’t celebrate too soon. This is just the beginning.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "298156980": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1838698250,
   "children": [
    -270390670
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Can’t wait to test it on you...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-270390670": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 298156980,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Heehee… you’re so bad! But also, yes please.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1404837631": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 607599665,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well duh! But beginnings are the best part. That’s when you get all hyped up!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1941922044": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 163401542,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yeah! We’ll be overflowing with bottles in no time. Moo-power!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1432733156": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Alright, listen. We’ve got two big things to do now.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-293575018": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "First, we need more women. I can’t fill the quota by myself, no matter how much milk I make. You’ll have to go find other girls willing to… join the herd.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2095338421": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    150354281,
    -991365574,
    550686468
   ],
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Second, we’ll need someone to actually do the milking in the barn. That’s where you come in. Heehee. Don’t worry, it’ll be fun.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "150354281": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2095338421,
   "children": [
    -1456782839
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I’ll help however I can.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-991365574": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2095338421,
   "children": [
    -354365781
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Do I at least get paid in cookies?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "550686468": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2095338421,
   "children": [
    1288108566
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I don’t mind handling your udders myself.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1456782839": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 150354281,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Knew I could count on you!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-354365781": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -991365574,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Sure! Cookies, hugs, and fresh milk. Best deal ever.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1288108566": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 550686468,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Pfft! Naughty… but yes, that’s exactly the plan.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-138764934": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, and one more thing. Clay’s still got a bunch of old stuff lying around from the previous owners of the farm.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "35166899": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Tools, gear, weird junk… I think he might even sell some of it if you ask nice.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
